### SimpleBase API 调用样例（proto.http）
###
### 用法：
###   1. VS Code 安装 "REST Client" 扩展（humao.rest-client），点击请求上方的 "Send Request"；
###      或用 JetBrains HTTP Client（IntelliJ/GoLand 内置）直接运行本文件。
###   2. 先启动 DevMode 后端（config.yaml 中 dev_mode: true）：
###        go run ./cmd/simplebased      # 或 ./simplebased
###   3. DevMode 种子数据已内置（internal/app/app.go）：
###        project = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002（展示名「商城后台」），
###        database = default（自动创建），
###        API key = sb_live_dev_key_12345（含 Read/Write/Admin/ProjectAdmin）
###        系统库 simplebase-system 不出现在 GET .../databases 列表中。
###
### 契约文档：plan/planv2.0/proto-http.md
### 所有 /v1/* 路由要求 Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>
###
### 注意：@databaseId 需先执行「1.1 列出数据库」或「1.2 创建数据库」后，
###       把真实 ID 填到下面的变量里（REST Client 的 response 变量跨请求不稳定，
###       手工填写最可靠）。

@host = http://localhost:8080
@project = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@apiKey = sb_live_dev_key_12345
@auth = Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 执行 1.1 后把返回的 databases[0].id 粘到这里
@databaseId = REPLACE_WITH_REAL_DATABASE_ID

### =====================================================================
### 0. 基础设施（无认证）
### =====================================================================

### 0.1 存活探针（不做 I/O，恒 200）
GET {{host}}/health/live

### 0.2 就绪探针（检查 catalog / S3 依赖，未就绪返回 503）
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### 0.3 Prometheus 指标（文本格式，非 JSON，供 Prom/Grafana 抓取）
# GET {{host}}/metrics

### =====================================================================
### 1. 数据库管理（DatabaseAdmin / DatabaseRead）
### =====================================================================

### 1.1 列出项目下数据库 → 200 {"databases":[...],"next_cursor":""}
### limit 默认 50，合法范围 1-200（越界会返回 500 internal_error）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases?limit=20
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1.2 创建数据库 → 201 DatabaseResponse（status 为 "creating"）
### 名称 1-63 字节，不含 / \ 和控制字符；body 含未知字段直接 400
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "analytics"
}

### 1.3 数据库详情 → 200（唯一可能返回 snapshot 字段的接口）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1.4 打开数据库（预热：取租约后立即释放）→ 200 DatabaseResponse
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/open
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1.5 关闭数据库（仅释放本地连接，不删 S3 数据）→ 204 无 body
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/close
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1.6 创建备份 → 501 {"error":{"code":"not_implemented",...}}（尚未实现）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/backups
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1.7 恢复数据库 → 501 not_implemented（尚未实现）
# POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/restore
# Authorization: {{auth}}

### 1.8 删除数据库 → 202 {"database_id":"...","status":"deleting"}（软删除）
# DELETE {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}
# Authorization: {{auth}}

### =====================================================================
### 2. SQL 执行（query 只读 / execute、batch 需写权限）
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 元数据查询：列出当前 schema 的表
### 响应 rows 是二维数组，需与 columns 按下标对应
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/query
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "SELECT table_name FROM information_schema.tables WHERE table_schema = current_schema()",
  "max_rows": 50
}

### 2.2 建表（DuckLake 无 PRIMARY KEY / sequence，id 由应用层生成 UUID）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/execute
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS \"users\" (id VARCHAR NOT NULL, data VARCHAR NOT NULL, created_at VARCHAR NOT NULL)"
}

### 2.3 插入数据（必须参数化占位符，禁止字符串拼接）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/execute
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "INSERT INTO \"users\" (id, data, created_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)",
  "args": ["u-1001", "{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"age\":28}", "2026-09-15T12:00:00Z"]
}

### 2.4 带参数条件查询 → 200 QueryResponse
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/query
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "SELECT id, data, created_at FROM \"users\" WHERE id = ?",
  "args": ["u-1001"]
}

### 2.5 批量执行（事务模式：任一失败整体回滚，响应带 error.failed_index）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/batch
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactional": true,
  "statements": [
    { "sql": "INSERT INTO \"users\" (id, data, created_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)", "args": ["u-2001", "{\"name\":\"Bob\"}", "2026-09-15T12:01:00Z"] },
    { "sql": "INSERT INTO \"users\" (id, data, created_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)", "args": ["u-2002", "{\"name\":\"Carol\"}", "2026-09-15T12:02:00Z"] }
  ]
}

### 2.6 批量执行（非事务模式：失败项带 error_code，后续语句继续执行）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/batch
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactional": false,
  "statements": [
    { "sql": "UPDATE \"users\" SET data = ? WHERE id = ?", "args": ["{\"name\":\"Alice v2\"}", "u-1001"] },
    { "sql": "DELETE FROM \"users\" WHERE id = ?", "args": ["u-2002"] }
  ]
}

### =====================================================================
### 3. 文档数据 API
###
### 注意：本组路径不含 databaseID，服务端自动取该项目的「第一个」数据库
###       （ListDatabases limit=1）。多库项目下不要假设它等于你在 §1 选的库。
###       项目下无任何库时返回 500 internal_error。
### =====================================================================

### 3.1 列出集合（实为 information_schema 表清单，最多 200 条）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/data/collections
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 3.2 创建集合 → 201 无 body
### 名称须匹配 ^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_]{0,62}$，否则 400 invalid_request
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/data/collections
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "orders"
}

### 3.3 列出文档 → 200 {"rows":[...]}（表不存在返回空数组而非 404，最多 1000 行）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/data/collections/users
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 3.4 插入文档 → 201 回显文档
### body 为任意 JSON 对象；可自带 id，缺省服务端生成 UUID；表不存在会自动建表
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/data/collections/users/documents
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "u-3001",
  "name": "Dave",
  "tags": ["vip", "beta"],
  "profile": { "city": "Shenzhen", "level": 3 }
}

### 3.5 更新文档 → 200 回显（body 中的 id 会被剔除；文档不存在返回 404 not_found）
PUT {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/data/collections/users/documents/u-3001
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dave Chen",
  "tags": ["vip"]
}

### 3.6 删除文档 → 204 无 body（表不存在也返回 204，幂等）
# DELETE {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/data/collections/users/documents/u-3001
# Authorization: {{auth}}

### =====================================================================
### 4. S3 对象存储
###
### 项目隔离：服务端自动在物理 key 前拼 {projectID}/，返回的 key 已剥掉项目段。
### 字段命名例外：本组用 camelCase lastModified（其余接口为 snake_case）。
### =====================================================================

### 4.1 列出对象（prefix 可空；空串时跳过 key 校验；最多 1000 条）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/s3/objects?prefix=
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 4.2 上传对象 → 200 {"key","size","lastModified"}
### multipart/form-data，字段名固定为 key + file
### 体积受 limits.max_request_bytes 限制（config.yaml 默认 10MB），超限 413
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/s3/objects
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="key"

notes/hello.txt
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello SimpleBase S3!
--WebAppBoundary--

### 4.3 预签名下载 URL → 200 {"url":"..."}（TTL 固定 15 分钟）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/s3/presign?key=notes/hello.txt
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 4.4 删除对象 → 200 {"ok":true}
# DELETE {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/s3/objects?key=notes/hello.txt
# Authorization: {{auth}}

### 4.5 非法 key 演示 → 400 invalid_file_key（含 .. 穿越段）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/s3/presign?key=../etc/passwd
Authorization: {{auth}}

### =====================================================================
### 5. LLM Gateway
###
### 路由权限为 DatabaseRead（不是 LLMInvoke）；额外受 CheckQuota(project,"llm") 限制。
### DevMode 未配置 LLM provider 时 providers 返回空数组、chat/stream 报错。
### =====================================================================

### 5.1 可用供应商列表 → 200 {"providers":[...]}
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/llm/providers
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 5.2 非流式对话 → 200 {content, usage, model, provider, finish_reason}
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/llm/chat
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "用一句话介绍 DuckLake" }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 256,
  "temperature": 0.7
}

### 5.3 流式对话（SSE：data: {...} 逐帧，结束帧 {"type":"end"}）
### model/max_tokens/temperature 均可省略，由项目默认供应商配置决定
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/llm/stream
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "写一个 Go 的 hello world" }
  ]
}

### 5.4 空 messages 演示 → 实际返回 500 internal_error（不是 400，见 proto-http.md §6.3）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/llm/chat
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": []
}

### =====================================================================
### 6. 配额与审计
### =====================================================================

### 6.1 配额可用状态 → 200 {"llm_allowed":true,"database_allowed":true}
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/quota
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6.2 审计事件列表 → 200 {"operations":[...],"limit":50}
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/audit?limit=50
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6.3 项目列表 → 200 {"projects":[{"id":"...","name":"商城后台"}]}
GET {{host}}/v1/projects
Authorization: {{auth}}

### =====================================================================
### 6b. Metrics / Logs / Settings / LLM sessions（系统库）
### =====================================================================

### 6b.1 Dashboard summary
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/metrics/summary
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6b.2 Dashboard trend
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/metrics/trend?days=7
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6b.3 Logs
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/logs?limit=50
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6b.4 LLM settings
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/llm/settings
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 6b.5 LLM sessions
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/llm/sessions
Authorization: {{auth}}

### =====================================================================
### 7. 错误协议演示（验证前端拦截器行为）
### =====================================================================

### 7.1 缺失认证头 → 401 {"error":{"code":"unauthenticated",...}}
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases

### 7.2 错误 API Key → 401 {"error":{"code":"invalid_api_key",...}}
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases
Authorization: Bearer sb_live_wrong_key

### 7.3 不存在的 project → 404 database_not_found
### （ResolveProjectTenant 返回 catalog.ErrNotFound，错误码未区分 project/database）
GET {{host}}/v1/projects/proj-not-exist/databases
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 7.4 只读意图里提交写语句 → 400 write_in_read_only
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases/{{databaseId}}/query
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "DELETE FROM \"users\""
}

### 7.5 创建库 body 含未知字段 → 400 invalid_request（DisallowUnknownFields）
POST {{host}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/databases
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "tmp",
  "unknown_field": 1
}

### 7.6 不存在的 API 路由 → SPA fallback 返回 HTML（非 404 JSON）
### 前端拦截器会把 content-type: text/html 转为「接口不存在或返回了 HTML 页面」
GET {{host}}/metrics/summary

###
### 补充说明：
### - @databaseId 需手工填写（见文件顶部）；REST Client 的 {{req.response.body.x}}
###   跨请求引用在多数版本中不稳定，故本文件不使用响应链变量。
### - 以 # 注释的请求为破坏性操作（删除库/文档/对象）或需前序步骤，按需打开。
### - proto-http.md §3.8 列出前端已调用但后端不存在的路由：
###   /metrics/summary、/metrics/trend、/faas/*、/ws/logs —— 它们都会命中 SPA
###   fallback 返回 index.html，而非 404 JSON。


###
# ============================================================
# LLM Settings / Provider credentials（§3.9，后端未实现 — 仅契约样例）
# 打开前请确认服务端已按 ui-settings-chat-plan.md 落地，否则会 SPA fallback HTML
# ============================================================

# @name llmSettingsGet
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/llm/settings
# Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

# @name llmSettingsPut
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/llm/settings
# Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "default_provider": "openai",
#   "default_model": "gpt-4o-mini",
#   "temperature": 0.7,
#   "max_tokens": 1024
# }

# @name llmProviderCatalog
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/llm/provider-catalog
# Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

# @name llmProviderConfigs
# GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/llm/provider-configs
# Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

# @name llmProviderConfigPut
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/llm/provider-configs/openai
# Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "enabled": true,
#   "default_model": "gpt-4o-mini",
#   "credentials": {
#     "api_key": "sk-replace-me"
#   }
# }
